# Issues
- Fixes #106 

# What and why was modified?

- Default log file added during initial setup to prevent tests to fail due to memory issues;
- Readme updated to make it explicit that are different distribution channels;
- NodeJS updated to v24 in .nvmrc and Dockerfiles to prevent vulnerabilities mapped to earlier versions;

### Reference links and evaluation steps

- GIVEN that dependencies are installed with pnpm install
- AND that all tests are run with pnpm test:unit
- THEN all tests should pass
